# title: PMEL CO2-Moorings — Oberflächen-pCO2 (diffusion, Ozeankohlenstoff)
url https://data.pmel.noaa.gov/pmel/erddap/tabledap/all_pmel_co2_moorings.json?time,longitude,latitude,pCO2_air&time%3E=max(time)-7days
ttl 86400
force diffusion
on earth 0 0 0
map table.rows
lat 2
lon 1
field 3 hydrosphere_pco2_mooring_uatm gaussian-inverse-square diffusion uatm 8640.0 0.0 0.0

accepted https://skyserver.sdss.org/dr18/SkyServerWS/SearchTools/SqlSearch?cmd=SELECT+TOP+3000+ra,dec,z,psfMag_r+FROM+SpecObj+WHERE+class%3D%27QSO%27&format=json&TaskName=Skyserver.Search.SQL
# title: SDSS DR18 SkyServer SQL — spektroskopische Objekte (em cmap, z via Hubble)
# note: Antwort ist [{TableName,Rows:[...]}] — Container-Pfad "0.Rows" gegen den cmap-Parser verifizieren
url https://skyserver.sdss.org/dr18/SkyServerWS/SearchTools/SqlSearch?cmd=SELECT+TOP+3000+ra,dec,z,psfMag_r+FROM+SpecObj+WHERE+class%3D%27QSO%27&format=json&TaskName=Skyserver.Search.SQL
ttl 86400
force em
at sun
cmap 0.Rows
ra ra
dec dec
z z
field psfMag_r sdss_psfmag_r inverse-square em mag 86400 0.0 0.0

